      "widgets_values": [
        "NMKD UPSCALE\nUPSCALE = true enables 4x NMKD followed by Lanczos 0.50 = net 2x.\nFINAL SIZE factors: 0.50 = net 2x; 0.375 = net 1.5x; 0.25 = processed original size.\nUPSCALE = false bypasses NMKD and resize only. COLOR MATCH has its own switch below.\nSAVE BASE is sampler output before both operations. SAVE FINAL is the selected result after the independent switches.\nDepth changes generation conditioning; base sampler parameters remain unchanged. With DEPTH OFF, base generation uses the original model + Millie LoRA path.\nAll three switches OFF = original generation path and unprocessed final pixels.\nBASE/FINAL comparison includes color correction if enabled; there is also a separate before/after Color Match comparison below.\nDefault input canvas remains 1080x1920. NMKD net 2x gives 2160x3840 when BASE is 1080x1920.\nNo extra diffusion pass or FaceDetailer is added. x4 intermediate image still uses memory.\nSee the DEPTH + COLOR controls below and UPUTSTVO_Depth_ColorMatch_v2.txt."
      ],
