    {
      "type": "Note",
      "size": [
        800,
        690
      ],
      "widgets_values": [
        "DEPTH + COLOR MATCH - INDEPENDENT SWITCHES\nUpload reference. DEPTH CONTROL = true; strength 0.75; Depth Anything V2 Large resolution 768.\nCOLOR MATCH = true; strength 0.30; method mkl.\nUPSCALE switch above stays independent. Each stage can be disabled without disabling the others.\nDepth adds guidance to the existing RawGirl model + Millie LoRA branch. Original ClownsharKSampler, prompt, seed, VAE, CFG and sampling settings are unchanged.\nThis remains TEXT TO IMAGE from an empty latent. Reference supplies depth and palette, not img2img initialization.\nGeneration resolution stays 1080x1920. No Auto Ratio was added. A different reference aspect ratio is center-cropped by the depth encoder to match the generation canvas. Use a matching 9:16 reference for full framing. ALIGNED DEPTH preview shows the actual encoded crop.\nColor Match is final processing after the selected upscale output. It changes palette/tones, not light direction, pose or facial expression.\nMain prompt is unchanged and must still describe the desired scene manually. No automatic captioning or lighting extraction.\nDependencies: comfyui-krea2-controlnet; comfyui_controlnet_aux; KJNodes; rgthree-comfy; color-matcher.\nModels: depth-control-lora.safetensors; depth_anything_v2_vitl.pth; the NMKD model used above.\nWhen Depth and Color are OFF, preview shows the reference; generation and upscaling do not need depth inference.\nNo GPU render or actual model compatibility test has been performed."
      ],
      "inputs": [],
      "outputs": [],
      "properties": {
        "Node name for S&R": "Note",
        "cnr_id": "comfy-core"
      },
